// Home Page Alignment - 표준 브레이크포인트 적용 버전
// 홈페이지 정렬 및 레이아웃 일관성 개선

// 임시 변수 및 믹스인 정의
$container-max-width-xl: 1280px;
$spacing-xl: 32px;
$spacing-lg: 16px;
$spacing-3xl: 48px;
$spacing-2xl: 24px;
$spacing-md: 12px;
$spacing-sm: 8px;
$spacing-4xl: 64px;
$transition-button: all 0.3s ease;
$font-size-3xl: 2.25rem;
$font-size-2xl: 1.875rem;
$font-size-xl: 1.5rem;
$font-size-lg: 1.125rem;
$font-size-base: 1rem;
$line-height-heading: 1.2;
$line-height-relaxed: 1.6;

@mixin mobile {
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    @content;
  }
}

@mixin media-down($breakpoint) {
  @if $breakpoint == 'md' {
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
      @content;
    }
  }
}

@mixin tablet {
  @media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1023px) {
    @content;
  }
}

#Home {
  /* 전체 레이아웃 중앙 정렬 */
  #container {
    .visual,
    .function,
    .contents,
    .schedule,
    .feedback {
      .inner {
        max-width: $container-max-width-xl;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 $spacing-xl;
        
        @include mobile {
          padding: 0 $spacing-lg;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  /* 비주얼 섹션 정렬 */
  .visual {
    .txt {
      text-align: left;
      
      > div {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: $spacing-lg;
      }
      
      h1, h2, p {
        text-align: left;
        margin: 0;
      }
      
      button {
        align-self: flex-start;
      }
      
      // 태블릿 이하에서 중앙 정렬
      @include media-down('md') {
        text-align: center;
        
        > div {
          align-items: center;
        }
        
        h1, h2, p {
          text-align: center;
        }
        
        button {
          align-self: center;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  /* 기능 섹션 정렬 */
  .function {
    .content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: $spacing-3xl;
      align-items: center;
      
      .txt {
        > div {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: $spacing-lg;
        }
        
        h3, p {
          text-align: left;
          margin: 0;
        }
        
        button {
          margin-top: $spacing-xl;
        }
      }
      
      .img {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        
        img {
          max-width: 100%;
          height: auto;
        }
      }
      
      // 태블릿 이하에서 단일 컬럼
      @include media-down('lg') {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: $spacing-2xl;
        
        .txt {
          > div {
            align-items: center;
          }
          
          h3, p {
            text-align: center;
          }
          
          button {
            margin: $spacing-xl auto 0;
            display: block;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }

  /* 컨텐츠 섹션 정렬 */
  .contents {
    .content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: $spacing-3xl;
      align-items: center;
      
      &.reverse {
        .img {
          order: -1;
        }
      }
      
      .txt {
        > div {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: $spacing-lg;
        }
        
        h3, p {
          text-align: left;
          margin: 0;
        }
        
        button {
          margin-top: $spacing-xl;
        }
      }
      
      .img {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        
        img {
          max-width: 100%;
          height: auto;
          object-fit: contain;
        }
      }
      
      // 태블릿 이하에서 단일 컬럼
      @include media-down('lg') {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: $spacing-2xl;
        
        &.reverse .img {
          order: 0;
        }
        
        .txt {
          > div {
            align-items: center;
          }
          
          h3, p {
            text-align: center;
          }
          
          button {
            margin: $spacing-xl auto 0;
            display: block;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }

  /* 스케줄 섹션 정렬 */
  .schedule {
    .content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: $spacing-4xl;
      align-items: center;
      
      .txt {
        > div {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: $spacing-lg;
        }
        
        h3, p {
          text-align: left;
          margin: 0;
        }
        
        button {
          margin-top: $spacing-xl;
        }
      }
      
      .img {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        
        img {
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 800px;
          height: auto;
        }
      }
      
      // 노트북 이하에서 이미지 크기 조정
      @include media-down('xl') {
        .img img {
          max-width: 600px;
        }
      }
      
      // 태블릿 이하에서 단일 컬럼
      @include media-down('lg') {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: $spacing-2xl;
        
        .txt {
          > div {
            align-items: center;
          }
          
          h3, p {
            text-align: center;
          }
          
          button {
            margin: $spacing-xl auto 0;
            display: block;
          }
        }
        
        .img img {
          max-width: 100%;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  /* 피드백 섹션 정렬 */
  .feedback {
    .content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: $spacing-4xl;
      align-items: center;
      
      .txt {
        > div {
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: $spacing-lg;
        }
        
        h3, p {
          text-align: left;
          margin: 0;
        }
        
        button {
          margin-top: $spacing-xl;
        }
      }
      
      .img {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        
        img {
          width: 100%;
          max-width: 800px;
          height: auto;
        }
      }
      
      // 노트북 이하에서 이미지 크기 조정
      @include media-down('xl') {
        .img img {
          max-width: 600px;
        }
      }
      
      // 태블릿 이하에서 단일 컬럼
      @include media-down('lg') {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: $spacing-2xl;
        
        .txt {
          > div {
            align-items: center;
          }
          
          h3, p {
            text-align: center;
          }
          
          button {
            margin: $spacing-xl auto 0;
            display: block;
          }
        }
        
        .img img {
          max-width: 100%;
        }
      }
    }
  }

  /* 버튼 정렬 일관성 */
  button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: $transition-button;
    
    &:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
  }

  /* 모바일 최적화 */
  @include mobile {
    .visual {
      padding: $spacing-3xl 0;
      
      .txt {
        h1 {
          font-size: $font-size-3xl;
          line-height: $line-height-heading;
        }
        
        h2 {
          font-size: $font-size-2xl;
        }
        
        p {
          font-size: $font-size-base;
        }
      }
    }
    
    .function,
    .contents,
    .schedule,
    .feedback {
      padding: $spacing-2xl 0;
      
      h3 {
        font-size: $font-size-2xl;
        margin-bottom: $spacing-md;
      }
      
      p {
        font-size: $font-size-base;
        line-height: $line-height-relaxed;
      }
    }
  }

  /* 반응형 간격 조정 */
  @include tablet {
    section {
      padding: $spacing-3xl 0;
    }
  }
  
  @include desktop {
    section {
      padding: $spacing-4xl 0;
    }
  }
  
  @include wide {
    section {
      padding: $spacing-5xl 0;
    }
  }
}